  "description": "Goblin Gully is built around one long crawl tube that links two slides, with a star-shaped net climber in the middle. A transparent bubble panel lets children inside the tube see out, which gives them the feel of a hideout they have to find their way out of. The listed colours are Mineral and Lavender, and the photos show green and grey domes with a red slide. It suits children aged 5 to 12 and takes up to 15 at a time. Crawling the full tube builds endurance, and finding the exit builds problem solving. The product area is 29'10\" x 12'7\" and the safe play area is 34'10\" x 17'7\". Its main materials carry a 3-year warranty. Tell us your plot size for a quote.",
